c us fita in taknelik","poem":1},{"text":"Fah foloko ke pusren on in engan","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ke elos us fokin kosrani lalos.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kos_pub/PSA/126.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kos_pub/PSA/127.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kos_pub/PSA/125.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}